    <item>
      <title>Transformer Architecture Deep Dive</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1314/learning/transformer-architecture/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1314/learning/transformer-architecture/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Overview 
    &lt;div id=&#34;overview&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#overview&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Transformer architecture, introduced in &amp;ldquo;Attention Is All You Need&amp;rdquo; (Vaswani et al., 2017), revolutionized natural language processing by replacing recurrent and convolutional layers with self-attention mechanisms.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Key Components 
    &lt;div id=&#34;key-components&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#key-components&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;1. Self-Attention Mechanism 
    &lt;div id=&#34;1-self-attention-mechanism&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#1-self-attention-mechanism&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The core innovation of transformers is the self-attention mechanism, which allows the model to focus on different parts of the input sequence when processing each element.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
